# Only package inputs enter the build context, never local credentials or history.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
# Keep accidental local/generated files out even if placed inside src.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.egg-info/
